<title>ITALY: TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN MEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN MEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $2.3 million Italian Open men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix denotes seed):</p>
<p>Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Sandon Stolle (Australia)  6-1 6-4</p>
<p>11-Albert Costa (Spain) beat Alex Radulescu (Germany)  7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat 2-Michael Chang (U.S.) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Davide Sanguinetti (Italy) 5-7</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat Todd Woodbridge (Australia)</p>
<p>7-5 6-1</p>
<p>12-Boris Becker (Germany) beat Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 6-2</p>
<p>14-Tim Henman (Britain) beat Roberto Carretero (Spain) 4-6 7-5</p>
<p>2-0 retired</p>
<p>4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Javier Sanchez (Spain) 7-5</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Scott Draper (Australia) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 7-5</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Jim Courier (U.S.) beat 1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) 7-6 (7-5) 6-4</p>
<p>Tommy Haas (Germany) beat Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) 3-6 6-4 7-5 Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Felix Mantilla (Spain) 6-1 3-6 6-4 Davide Scala (Italy) beat Daniele Musa (Italy) 6-4 6-7 (3-7) 7-6 (7-4) 6-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Mark Woodforde (Australia) 6-2 6-7 (8-10) 6-4 7-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Omar Camporese (Italy) 6-3 7-5</p>
</text>
